{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"95dd4d7652ad4ce9","type":"group","x":-200,"y":-220,"width":1040,"height":1200,"label":"reference"},
		{"id":"f1f44fa077bca402","type":"group","x":3680,"y":-160,"width":1264,"height":952,"label":"Untitled group"},
		{"id":"f90aebf5959501fb","type":"group","x":-200,"y":1040,"width":829,"height":971,"label":"Untitled group"},
		{"id":"e52a3027a2812d12","type":"text","text":"Navbar (Navigation Bar) aapki website ka wo hissa hai jo users ko alag-alag pages par jaane aur theme badalne me madad karta hai. Aapka navbar ekdum modern **\"Glassmorphism\"** (transparent kanch jaisa) design follow karta hai.\n\nChaliye iske code aur logic ko samajhte hain.\n\n### 1. HTML Code (Skeleton)\nAapke Navbar ko 3 main hisso (Left, Center, Right) mein baanta gaya hai taaki har cheez apni jagah par achhe se set rahe.\n\n```html\n<!-- Navbar ki main body -->\n<nav class=\"glass-navbar\">\n  \n  <!-- LEFT HISSA: Aapka Logo aur Naam -->\n  <div class=\"nav-left\">\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-logo\">\n      <div class=\"logo-icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\">...</svg> <!-- Vector Logo -->\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"brand-text\">AAYUSH</span>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- CENTER HISSA: Baki pages ke links -->\n  <div class=\"nav-center\">\n    <a href=\"index.html\" class=\"nav-link active\"><i class=\"ph ph-house\"></i><span>Home</span></a>\n    <a href=\"work.html\" class=\"nav-link\"><i class=\"ph ph-briefcase\"></i><span>Work</span></a>\n    <a href=\"blogs.html\" class=\"nav-link\"><i class=\"ph ph-pen-nib\"></i><span>Blog</span></a>\n    <a href=\"resume.html\" class=\"nav-link\"><i class=\"ph ph-file-text\"></i><span>Resume</span></a>\n  </div>\n  \n  <!-- Chhoti si vertical line (Divider) -->\n  <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n  \n  <!-- RIGHT HISSA: Theme badalne ka button aur dropdown menu -->\n  <div class=\"nav-right\">\n    <div class=\"theme-switcher\" id=\"themeSwitcher\">\n      \n      <!-- Current Theme Button -->\n      <div class=\"current-theme\" id=\"themeBtn\">\n        <span id=\"themeIcon\"><i class=\"ph ph-planet\"></i></span>\n        <span id=\"themeLabel\">Theme</span>\n        <i class=\"ph ph-caret-down chevron\"></i>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Chhupa hua Dropdown Menu jo click karne par khulta hai -->\n      <div class=\"theme-dropdown\" id=\"themeDropdown\">\n        <div class=\"theme-option\" data-theme=\"space\">Night Mode</div>\n        <div class=\"theme-option\" data-theme=\"rain\">Rain Mode</div>\n        <div class=\"theme-option\" data-theme=\"snow\">Snow Mode</div>\n        <!-- (Aur bhi baki themes) -->\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n```\n\n**Ye Kaise Kaam Karta Hai:**\n* Har hissa ek `div` mein pack kiya gaya hai.\n* Icons ke liye aapne **Phosphor Icons** (`<i class=\"ph ph-house\"></i>`) ka use kiya hai jo ki internet se directly load ho rahe hain.\n\n---\n\n### 2. CSS Code (The Styling Magic)\nAb dekhte hain ki HTML ko glass (kanch) ka look aur ek seedhi line (row) me arrange kaise kiya gaya hai:\n\n```css\n/* Navbar ko kaanch (Glass) jaisa effect dena */\n.glass-navbar {\n  /* Colors aur background blur */\n  background: var(--theme-bg-glass);       /* Transparent color */\n  backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%); /* Asli Glass Effect (Background ko blur karta hai) */\n  \n  /* Size aur borders */\n  border-radius: 32px;                     /* Gole kinare (Rounded corners) */\n  border: 1px solid var(--theme-border);   /* Halki si outline */\n  padding: 8px 20px;\n  \n  /* Flexbox Logic (Items ko ek line me set karna) */\n  display: flex;                           \n  align-items: center;                     /* Upar-niche (vertically) center me rakhna */\n  justify-content: space-between;          /* Teeno hisso ke beech mein barabar jagah chhodna */\n  flex-wrap: nowrap;                       /* Mobile par bhi sab kuch ek hi line me rakhna */\n}\n\n/* Links ko hover karne par color badalna */\n.nav-link:hover, .nav-link.active {\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n  color: var(--theme-accent); /* Ye theme ke hisaab se color badal lega (blue, green, etc.) */\n}\n```\n\n**Ye Kaise Kaam Karta Hai:**\n* `backdrop-filter: blur(20px)`: Ye navbar ke pichhe wale video/image ko blur kar deta hai, isiliye wo shishe (glass) jaisa dikhta hai.\n* `display: flex`: Ye ek aisi technique hai jo left, center aur right divs ko ek hi seedhi horizontal line mein set kar deti hai. `justify-content: space-between` se unke beech ka space auto-adjust ho jata hai.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Mobile View CSS (Responsive)\nJab aapki website kisi chote mobile me khulti hai, toh itna lamba navbar screen se bahar chala jayega. Isko bachane ke liye CSS me ek **Media Query** hai:\n\n```css\n@media (max-width: 550px) {\n  /* Text chhupa do, sirf Icons dikhao */\n  .nav-link span {\n    display: none; \n  }\n  \n  /* Brand ka naam bhi chhupa do */\n  .brand-text {\n    display: none;\n  }\n}\n```\n**Ye Kaise Kaam Karta Hai:**\nJaise hi screen ki width 550px se kam hoti hai, ye CSS \"Home\", \"Work\", \"AAYUSH\" aadi shabd (text) ko gayab (`display: none`) kar deta hai. Navbar par ab sirf **chote icons bachte hain**, aur navbar chota hokar mobile screen par perfectly fit ho jata hai!","x":-900,"y":280,"width":300,"height":280},
		{"id":"ed1f18b3bc2445de","type":"text","text":"Aapki website ka **Hero Section** (jo main center box hai jaha aapki photo aur details hain) ek bahut hi advance aur interactive card hai. Ye \"Glassmorphism\" ke sath-sath 3D animations aur live integrations (Spotify) use karta hai.\n\nChaliye dekhte hain isme kya-kya details hain aur ye kaise bana hai!\n\n### 1. Hero Section Kaise Kaam Karta Hai? (The Logic)\nAapka Hero section 3 hisso (Columns) mein baanta gaya hai:\n* **Left (Profile):** Ek bada sa circular `div` (`.avatar-wrapper`) jisme aapki photo bilkul center me clip (crop) hoti hai. Isme halki si shadow hai jisse ye thoda ubhra hua (pop-out) lagta hai.\n* **Center (Info & Content):** Yaha aapka Naam, Typewriter effect (Engineer, Web Developer), thoda sa Introduction, Spotify ka Live Music Player, aur aapke Social Media icons (X, LinkedIn, Github) hain.\n* **Right (3D Character):** Yaha ek 3D transparent PNG image hai jo CSS `@keyframes float` animation ki madad se continuously hawa me upar-niche tairti (float) rehti hai. Isme ek \"haa!\" likha hua chota text bubble bhi hai jo ghoomta rehta hai.\n\n**Mobile Logic:** Jab screen chhoti hoti hai, toh ye teeno hisse ek ke niche ek (column) me aane lagte hain. Aur humne haal hi me jo update kiya tha, uski wajah se 3D character apni jagah se uthkar absolute positioning se Profile Photo ke theek right side mein chipak jata hai!\n\n---\n\n### 2. AI Prompt (Naya Hero Section Banwane Ke Liye)\nAgar aapko bilkul aisa hi ek premium Hero section kisi naye project ke liye banana ho, toh AI ko ye prompt dijiye:\n\n> \"Create a modern Glassmorphism Hero Section using HTML and Vanilla CSS. The container should have `backdrop-filter: blur(20px)`, a semi-transparent dark background, and rounded corners. Inside, divide it into 3 flex items:\n> 1. Left: A glowing circular profile picture wrapper.\n> 2. Center: A headline, a subheadline with a blinking cursor (simulating typewriter text), a brief description, a sleek Spotify playing widget, and a row of social media icons.\n> 3. Right: A 3D character PNG with a continuous floating animation (`@keyframes float`).\n> On mobile (max-width: 780px), change the flex-direction to column, and position the 3D character absolutely to the right side of the profile picture to save space.\"\n\n---\n\n### 3. Complete Ready-to-Use Code (Hero Section)\nYe raha bilkul simple HTML aur CSS ka code jo aap copy-paste karke seedha test kar sakte hain. Isme background, profile aur animations already kaam karenge:\n\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Glassmorphism Hero Section</title>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;600;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <script src=\"https://unpkg.com/@phosphor-icons/web\"></script>\n\n  <style>\n    /* 1. Base Setup */\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 40px 20px;\n      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n      background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534796636918-a1d8f0583789?q=80&w=2000') no-repeat center/cover;\n      height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n\n    /* 2. Glassmorphism Hero Container */\n    .hero-container {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 40px;\n      background: rgba(10, 15, 30, 0.65);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(25px) saturate(180%);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      border-radius: 40px;\n      padding: 50px;\n      max-width: 1000px;\n      width: 100%;\n      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n    }\n\n    /* 3. Left - Profile Image */\n    .avatar-wrapper {\n      width: 250px;\n      height: 250px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      border: 4px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(79, 143, 255, 0.4);\n    }\n    .avatar-wrapper img {\n      width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;\n    }\n\n    /* 4. Center - Text & Info */\n    .hero-center { flex: 1; color: white; }\n    \n    .hero-name {\n      font-size: 3rem; margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-weight: 800;\n    }\n    \n    .hero-subtitle {\n      font-size: 1.5rem; color: #4f8fff; margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n    }\n    \n    .hero-desc {\n      color: #a0aec0; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n\n    /* Social Links */\n    .social-row { display: flex; gap: 15px; }\n    .social-btn {\n      width: 45px; height: 45px;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;\n      color: white; font-size: 1.3rem; text-decoration: none;\n      transition: all 0.3s;\n    }\n    .social-btn:hover {\n      background: #4f8fff; transform: translateY(-5px);\n    }\n\n    /* 5. Right - 3D Character Floating Animation */\n    .hero-right { width: 200px; }\n    \n    .character-wrapper {\n      width: 100%;\n      animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite; /* Yaha jadu ho raha hai! */\n    }\n    .character-wrapper img { width: 100%; filter: drop-shadow(0 20px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)); }\n\n    @keyframes float {\n      0% { transform: translateY(0px); }\n      50% { transform: translateY(-20px); }\n      100% { transform: translateY(0px); }\n    }\n\n    /* 6. Mobile View (Jab Screen Choti Ho) */\n    @media (max-width: 800px) {\n      .hero-container {\n        flex-direction: column; text-align: center; padding: 40px 20px; position: relative;\n      }\n      .avatar-wrapper { width: 200px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto 20px; }\n      .social-row { justify-content: center; }\n      \n      /* Mobile par 3D character ko profile pic ke Right me lagana */\n      .hero-right {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 60px;\n        left: 50%;\n        transform: translateX(80px); /* Profile se thoda bahar nikalna */\n        width: 100px;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- HERO SECTION HTML -->\n  <div class=\"hero-container\">\n    \n    <!-- LEFT -->\n    <div class=\"hero-left\">\n      <div class=\"avatar-wrapper\">\n        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?w=500&q=80\" alt=\"Profile\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- CENTER -->\n    <div class=\"hero-center\">\n      <h1 class=\"hero-name\">John Doe</h1>\n      <h2 class=\"hero-subtitle\">Creative Developer <span style=\"animation: blink 1s infinite;\">|</span></h2>\n      <p class=\"hero-desc\">I design and code beautifully simple things, and I love what I do. Exploring the latest tech to build modern web experiences.</p>\n      \n      <div class=\"social-row\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"social-btn\"><i class=\"ph ph-github-logo\"></i></a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"social-btn\"><i class=\"ph ph-linkedin-logo\"></i></a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"social-btn\"><i class=\"ph ph-twitter-logo\"></i></a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT -->\n    <div class=\"hero-right\">\n      <div class=\"character-wrapper\">\n        <!-- Ek transparent rocket PNG as dummy 3D character -->\n        <img src=\"https://cdn3d.iconscout.com/3d/premium/thumb/rocket-2872322-2389547.png\" alt=\"3D Character\">\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\nIs file ko agar aap browser me run karenge toh aap dekhenge ki bina kisi extra image ke (internet se images fetch karke) ek dam solid floating Glassmorphism hero section kaam kar raha hai!","x":-880,"y":580,"width":280,"height":260},
		{"id":"c32f477584b89c0c","type":"text","text":"hero section ","x":-1220,"y":-200,"width":332,"height":200},
		{"id":"436f01616d3669af","type":"file","file":"Excalidraw/Daily.excalid.md","x":-1220,"y":20,"width":280,"height":240},
		{"id":"8276f9415beb20c7","type":"text","text":"![[Excalidraw/Daily.excalid.md#^group=eaRt2ucH|100%]]\n\nBohot hi aasan shabdo mein, aapki website ek **\"3-part system\"** par kaam kar rahi hai. Jaise ek insaan ka sharir (body), kapde (clothes), aur dimaag (brain) hota hai, waise hi aapki website ke teen main hisse hain: **HTML, CSS, aur JavaScript.**\n\nChaliye isko step-by-step samajhte hain:\n\n### 1. 🦴 HTML (`index.html`) - \"The Skeleton\" (Dhancha)\nHTML aapki website ki haddiya (skeleton) hai. Ye browser ko batata hai ki page par kya-kya hona chahiye. \n* Aapne HTML me alag-alag dibbe (divs) banaye hain.\n* Ek dibba **Navbar** ke liye hai.\n* Ek **Profile Picture** ke liye hai, ek **Text** ke liye, aur ek **3D Avatar** ke liye.\n* Aur sabse pichhe aapne **Background Videos/Images** ke dibbe chhupa ke rakhe hain.\n\n### 2. 👗 CSS (`home.css`) - \"The Makeup & Clothes\" (Sundarta)\nCSS ka kaam hai HTML ko khubsurat banana. Ye aapki website ko premium \"Glassmorphism\" (kaanch jaisa) look deta hai.\n* **Theme Colors:** CSS mein aapne variables (jaise `--theme-accent`) define kiye hain. Jab theme badalti hai, toh bas ye color codes badal jaate hain aur poori website ka rang ek second me change ho jata hai.\n* **Animations:** Jo apka 3D character hawa mein tair (float) raha hai, wo CSS ki `@keyframes` animation se ho raha hai. CSS use baar-baar upar-niche push kar rahi hai.\n* **Mobile View:** CSS ye bhi check karti hai ki user ka screen chhota hai ya bada (`@media max-width`). Agar mobile hai, toh wo profile picture aur 3D avatar ki size choti kar deti hai aur unhe sahi jagah bitha deti hai.\n\n### 3. 🧠 JavaScript (`home.js`) - \"The Brain\" (Dimaag)\nJavaScript website ko zinda (dynamic) aur smart banati hai. Isme aapne 4 bade magic kiye hain:\n* **Theme Switcher:** Jab aap 'Rain' ya 'Snow' button dabate hain, toh JS `body` tag me ek class (jaise `<body class=\"rain\">`) add kar deti hai. Ye dekhte hi CSS baki sab background chhupa deti hai aur sirf rain wala background dikhati hai. JS ye bhi yaad rakhti hai (localStorage me) ki aapne kaunsi theme chuni thi, taaki refresh karne par wahi wapas aaye.\n* **Rain & Snow Effects:** Background me jo baarish aur barf gir rahi hai, wo kisi video ka hissa nahi hai! JS ek blank canvas par har ek boond (drop) ki X aur Y position calculate karke use har second 60 baar draw kar rahi hai jisse wo girti hui dikhti hai.\n* **Spotify Integration:** JS har 15 second chupke se internet ke zariye Spotify ke server se baat karti hai (API ke through). Pata karti hai ki aap abhi kaunsa gaana sun rahe ho, aur bina page refresh kiye us gaane ka naam aapki website par likh deti hai.\n* **Typewriter Effect:** Jo \"Engineer\", \"Web Developer\" type aur delete ho raha hai, wo JS kar rahi hai. Wo ek word leti hai, ek-ek alphabet screen par dalti hai thodi delay ke sath, aur jab poora word type ho jata hai toh usko delete karke naya word start kar deti hai.\n\n**Summary:** \n**HTML** ne page ka structure banaya, **CSS** ne usko kaanch jaisa khubsurat aur mobile-friendly banaya, aur **JavaScript** ne usme jaan daal di (themes, snow, aur Spotify connect karke). \n\nAapne ek bahut hi modern aur technically strong website banayi hai! 🚀","x":-1220,"y":280,"width":300,"height":280},
		{"id":"d612814853dc72f0","type":"text","text":"Agar aapko future me kisi naye project ke liye bilkul aisa hi **Glassmorphism Navbar** AI se banwana ho, toh aap ye prompt use kar sakte hain. Saath hi, main aapko pura ready-to-use HTML aur CSS code bhi de raha hu jo aap seedha copy-paste karke use kar sakte hain.\n\n### 🤖 1. AI Prompt (Isko copy karke kisi bhi AI ko de sakte hain)\n> \"Create a modern, responsive Glassmorphism Navbar using HTML and Vanilla CSS. The navbar should have 3 sections: a Left section with a logo and brand text, a Center section with 4 navigation links (Home, Work, Blog, Resume) using Phosphor Icons, and a Right section with a Theme dropdown button. \n> Use flexbox with `justify-content: space-between` to align them. Apply `backdrop-filter: blur(20px)` and a semi-transparent dark background for the glass effect. On mobile screens (max-width: 600px), hide the text labels for the links and the brand text, displaying only the icons to keep it in a single line without wrapping.\"\n\n---\n\n### 💻 2. Complete Ready-to-Use Code\nIs code me maine jaruri external links (Google Fonts aur Icons) include kar diye hain taaki ye seedha copy-paste karne par chalne lage. Isko aap ek nayi `index.html` file me daal kar test kar sakte hain:\n\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Glassmorphism Navbar</title>\n  \n  <!-- Fonts & Icons Load Kare -->\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;600;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <script src=\"https://unpkg.com/@phosphor-icons/web\"></script>\n\n  <style>\n    /* 1. Base Setup & Background set karne ke liye taaki glass effect dikhe */\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 20px;\n      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n      background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618005182384-a83a8bd57fbe?q=80&w=2000') no-repeat center center/cover;\n      height: 100vh;\n      color: #fff;\n    }\n\n    /* 2. Main Glass Navbar */\n    .glass-navbar {\n      background: rgba(10, 15, 30, 0.65);         /* Transparent Dark Color */\n      backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%); /* Asli Kaanch (Glass) Effect */\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); /* Halki si White border */\n      border-radius: 32px;\n      padding: 10px 24px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      flex-wrap: nowrap; /* Tute nahi ek line me rahe */\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n    }\n\n    /* 3. Navbar Sections */\n    .nav-left, .nav-right { flex-shrink: 0; }\n    \n    .nav-center {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 10px;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n\n    /* 4. Logo Style */\n    .nav-logo {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      color: #fff;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      font-size: 1.2rem;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n\n    /* 5. Center Links Style */\n    .nav-link {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      color: #a0aec0;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\n      padding: 8px 16px;\n      border-radius: 40px;\n      transition: all 0.3s;\n    }\n\n    .nav-link:hover, .nav-link.active {\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      color: #4f8fff; /* Blue accent */\n    }\n\n    /* 6. Theme Button Style */\n    .theme-btn {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      padding: 8px 16px;\n      border-radius: 40px;\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      border: none;\n      color: white;\n      font-family: inherit;\n    }\n\n    .theme-btn:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); }\n\n    /* 7. Mobile View (Jadui tareeke se text gayab aur chota navbar) */\n    @media (max-width: 650px) {\n      .glass-navbar {\n        padding: 8px 12px;\n      }\n      .brand-text, .nav-link span, .theme-btn span {\n        display: none; /* Mobile par saara text chupa do */\n      }\n      .nav-link {\n        padding: 8px 10px;\n        font-size: 1.2rem; /* Icons thode bade kardo */\n      }\n      .theme-btn {\n        padding: 8px 12px;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- NAVBAR HTML -->\n  <nav class=\"glass-navbar\">\n    \n    <!-- Left: Logo -->\n    <div class=\"nav-left\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-logo\">\n        <i class=\"ph-fill ph-planet\" style=\"color: #4f8fff; font-size: 1.5rem;\"></i>\n        <span class=\"brand-text\">AAYUSH</span>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Center: Links -->\n    <div class=\"nav-center\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-link active\"><i class=\"ph ph-house\"></i><span>Home</span></a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-link\"><i class=\"ph ph-briefcase\"></i><span>Work</span></a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-link\"><i class=\"ph ph-pen-nib\"></i><span>Blog</span></a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-link\"><i class=\"ph ph-file-text\"></i><span>Resume</span></a>\n    </div>\n    \n    <!-- Right: Theme Switcher -->\n    <div class=\"nav-right\">\n      <button class=\"theme-btn\">\n        <i class=\"ph ph-palette\"></i>\n        <span>Theme</span>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n\n  </nav>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\nBas is code block ko copy kijiye, ek HTML file banaiye aur double click karke browser mein open kariye. Background par mast ek nature ka image aayega aur upar aapka awesome Glassmorphism Navbar! 🌟","x":-1220,"y":580,"width":320,"height":280},
		{"id":"2b8af7cb8c56fb03","type":"text","text":"Listed directory my-portfolio\nListed directory css\nListed directory java%20scrips\nViewed index.html:1-215\nViewed common.css\nViewed home.js:1-772\nViewed blogs.js:1-326\n\nSure, main aapko aapke portfolio ka poora mechanism step-by-step samjhata hoon. Ye portfolio kafi advanced hai kyunki isme real-time API integration aur complex CSS animations use huye hain.\n\nMaine niche ek detailed guide create ki hai jo har section ke peeche ka logic aur code explain karti hai.\n\n### 📂 Portfolio Ka Pura Structure Samjhiye\n\nAapka portfolio basically 3 bade pillars par tika hai:\n1.  **HTML (Structure)**: `index.html`, `blogs.html`, etc.\n2.  **CSS (Design)**: `home.css`, `blogs.css` (Glassmorphism aur Themes ke liye).\n3.  **JavaScript (Brain)**: `home.js` aur `blogs.js` (Interactivity aur APIs ke liye).\n\n---\n\n### 1. 🌈 Theme System (The Brain of Look & Feel)\nAapke portfolio mein **6 different themes** hain (Space, Rain, Snow, etc.). \n- **Kaise kaam karta hai?**: Jab aap dropdown se koi theme select karte hain, toh JS `body` tag par us theme ki class (e.g., `.rain`) add kar deta hai.\n- **Persistence**: Aapne `localStorage` use kiya hai, jisse agar user page refresh kare ya agle din aaye, toh uska pasandida theme save rehta hai.\n- **Code Reference**: `home.js` mein `applyTheme()` function ye sab handle karta hai.\n\n### 2. ❄️ Particle Effects (Rain & Snow)\nRain aur Snow sirf images nahi hain, wo dynamic hain.\n- **Logic**: HTML5 `<canvas>` element ka use karke JavaScript har frame mein chote \"drops\" ya \"flakes\" draw karta hai.\n- **Animation Loop**: `requestAnimationFrame` use kiya gaya hai jo ki smooth animation deta hai (binna laptop hang kiye).\n\n### 3. ⌨️ Hero Section & Typing Effect\nAapka naam aur profession wala part kaafi dynamic hai.\n- **Typing Animation**: Ek simple array `roles = [\"Engineer\", \"Web Developer\", ...]` hai. JS ek-ek character add karta hai aur fir delete karta hai, jisse typewriter wala effect aata hai.\n- **Avatar Video**: Hero section mein image ki jagah `.mp4` video loop par chal raha hai jo premium look deta hai.\n\n### 4. 🎵 Spotify Integration (The Coolest Part)\nYe section real-time mein data fetch karta hai.\n- **OAuth Flow**: Ye Spotify API se connect hota hai. Maine isme `REFRESH_TOKEN` setup kiya hai taaki aapko baar-baar login na karna pade.\n- **iTunes Fallback**: Agar Spotify kisi gaane ka audio preview nahi deta, toh code automatically **iTunes API** se us gaane ka 30-second clip dhoondh leta hai.\n- **Polling**: Har 15 seconds mein code check karta hai ki aap abhi kya sun rahe hain.\n\n### 5. 🎬 Netflix-Style \"About Me\" Section\nYe section user engagement ke liye best hai.\n- **Auto-Slider**: Har 5 seconds mein card apne aap change hota hai.\n- **Pause on Hold**: Agar user kisi card par mouse rakhta hai ya mobile par press karke rakhta hai, toh timer ruk jata hai taaki wo padh sake.\n- **Intersection Observer**: Slider tabhi start hota hai jab user scroll karke us section tak pahunchta hai (Performance optimization).\n\n### 6. 📝 GitHub Blog Fetching\nAapke blog page (`blogs.html`) par content manually nahi likha gaya.\n- **Dynamic Content**: Ye aapke GitHub repository (Obsidian notes) se `.md` (Markdown) files uthata hai.\n- **Markdown Parser**: `marked.js` library use karke raw text ko sundar HTML mein convert kiya jata hai.\n- **Parallax Effect**: `blogs.js` mein mouse movement ke hisaab se layers move karti hain, jisse 3D depth wala feeling aata hai.\n\n### 7. ✨ Glassmorphism Design\nPura UI \"Glass\" jaisa dikhta hai.\n- **CSS Properties**: `backdrop-filter: blur(20px)` aur `background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)` ka use karke translucent look banaya gaya hai.\n- **Responsive**: `@media` queries use karke mobile par navigation ko single line mein adjust kiya gaya hai.\n\n---\n\n### 💡 Seekhne ke liye Tips:\n- Agar aapko **Spotify** change karna hai: `home.js` mein `REFRESH_TOKEN` update karein.\n- Agar aapko **Roles** badalne hain: `home.js` mein `roles` array update karein.\n- Agar aapko **Blogs** badalne hain: Bas apne GitHub repo mein new `.md` file add karein, wo yahan apne aap aa jayegi!\n\nKya aap kisi specific line of code ka matlab samjhna chahte hain?","x":-1220,"y":860,"width":340,"height":280},
		{"id":"410c65efd7039611","type":"text","text":"___\nstep 1 analysice tructure\nstep 2  name- how are you\nexprience, short bio\ntools choose\nstep 3 design layout sugessio\nhero exprience about /quote\n.\nlike aa recipe - kya kya dikhna hai \n\n----\n1. .Simple HTML/CSS se portfolio banao\n├── 5 pages (Home, Work, Blogs, Resume, Contact)\n├── Ek style.css sabke liye\n├── Loading screen (optional)\n└── Host karo (GitHub Pages / Netlify)\n2. JavaScript basics:\n├── Variables, functions, loops\n├── DOM manipulation (elements ko show/hide karna)\n├── Events (click, hover)\n└── LocalStorage (data save karna)\n3. React basics:\n├── Components (reusable blocks)\n├── Props & State (data manage karna)\n├── Hooks (useState, useEffect)\n├── Routing (pages ke liye)\n└── Build & deploy\n4. Apne purane HTML/CSS ko React mein convert karo:\n├── Header → Navbar component\n├── Hero section → Hero component\n├── Projects → ProjectCard component (reusable)\n├── CSS ko modules ya Tailwind mein convert karo\n└── Deploy on Vercel (best for React)\n\n\n","x":-840,"y":-200,"width":620,"height":440,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"66bd26ae3c23e371","type":"text","text":"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","x":-500,"y":240,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"e6843975b19c83e5","type":"text","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/broverse-com/home","x":-807,"y":1511,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"6ad8db5dcb775336","type":"text","text":"```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n<head>\n\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\n    <title>Home | My Portfolio</title>\n\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/css/style.css\">\n\n</head>\n\n<body>\n\n    <!-- Video Background Container -->\n\n<div class=\"video-bg\">\n\n    <video autoplay muted loop playsinline>\n\n        <source src=\"/videos/your_video.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n\n    </video>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-------------->\n\n    <!--===== HEADER (NAVIGATION) ===== -->\n\n    <header>\n\n        <div class=\"logo\">MyPortfolio</div>\n\n        <nav>\n\n            <a href=\"index.html\" class=\"active\">Home</a>\n\n            <a href=\"work.html\">Work</a>\n\n            <a href=\"blogs.html\">Blogs</a>\n\n            <a href=\"resume.html\">Resume</a>\n\n            <a href=\"contact.html\">Contact</a>\n\n        </nav>\n\n    </header>\n\n  \n\n    <!-- ===== MAIN CONTENT (HOME PAGE) ===== -->\n\n    <main>\n\n        <section class=\"hero\">\n\n            <img src=\"images/profile.jpg\" alt=\"My Photo\" class=\"profile-img\">\n\n            <h1>Hi, I'm [Your Name]</h1>\n\n            <p class=\"tagline\">Web Developer | Designer | Creator</p>\n\n            <p>I build modern websites that are fast, responsive, and user-friendly.</p>\n\n            <a href=\"work.html\" class=\"btn\">View My Work →</a>\n\n        </section>\n\n  \n\n        <section class=\"skills\">\n\n            <h2>What I Do</h2>\n\n            <div class=\"skills-grid\">\n\n                <div class=\"skill-card\">HTML5</div>\n\n                <div class=\"skill-card\">CSS3</div>\n\n                <div class=\"skill-card\">JavaScript</div>\n\n                <div class=\"skill-card\">Responsive Design</div>\n\n            </div>\n\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n  \n\n    <!-- ===== FOOTER ===== -->\n\n    <footer>\n\n        <p>© 2026 [Your Name]. All rights reserved.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"social-links\">\n\n            <a href=\"#\">GitHub</a> | <a href=\"#\">LinkedIn</a> | <a href=\"#\">Twitter</a>\n\n        </div>\n\n    </footer>\n\n  \n\n</body>\n\n</html>","x":2538,"y":-240,"width":602,"height":720},
		{"id":"dece1209fddd4683","type":"text","text":"","x":-134,"y":-213,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"020d9a8e14a6f952","type":"text","text":"learning fontend :\n 1st open pen and copy\n\n+ what is the project about\n+ what sthe main goal of the project\n+ what is the target audience\n+ what is the maiin feature of the project\n+ what is the main problem that the project is solving\n*remember focus on needs not design- user experience is matters*\n1. IN early dont think about making perfects -\ncolor schemes \nanimetions \nicons etc\nbad me focus \nocus on creating a **functional** and **usable** product first.\nafter you have product \nyou can start iterating on it \nimproving the deign \nadding animetions\nadding icons\nadding more features\n***Hierarchy*** \n= Importance ka order (kaun cheez sabse important hai, phir uske baad kya)\n- padding \n- margins\n- front size\n- line  hight\n\n\n\n\n\n","x":860,"y":-220,"width":380,"height":1220},
